   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <head type="letterhead">Board of Missions and Church Extension of The Methodist
               Church<lb/> 150 Fifth Avenue Newyork 11, N.Y.<lb/>Division of Foreign Missions</head>
            <opener><dateline rend="right"><date when="1945-10-15">October 15,
                  1945</date></dateline>
               <address>
                  <addrLine><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr. Paul
                     Tillich</rs><lb/> Union Theological Seminary<lb/> Broadway and 120 St.<lb/>
                     <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs> 27, <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__865" type="place">N.Y.</rs></addrLine>
               </address>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                  Tillich</rs>,</salute>
            </opener>

            <p>Herewith is a copy of <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3886" type="person">Dr.
               Soper</rs>'s book.<note type="ea">Das erwähnte Buch kann nicht eindeutig identifiziert werden.</note> It is my hope that you may give it careful reading before we meet
               <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3886" type="person">Dr. Soper</rs> next week to
               discuss it with him and others.</p>

            <p>Assuring you of my gratitude for this service, I am</p>

            <closer>
               <salute>Sincerely yours</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3882" type="person">R. E.
                  Diffendorfer</rs></signed> Executive Secretary </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
